2:T4a5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/judgment-apocalypse-survival-voice#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/judgment-apocalypse-survival-voice","headline":"Judgment Apocalypse Survival","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/judgment-apocalypse-survival-voice","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Judgment Apocalypse Survival Voice - The Apocalypse is here. Demons all around. Build, manage and defend your base in a post apocalyptic colony simulation","datePublished":"2016-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2016-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["Soft American"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/judgment-pocalypse-survival-voice.jpg"}}3:T442,<h2>Game Trailer Voice</h2>
<p>So, as a native British male voiceover artist it's fun to bring out the <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover" target="_blank" title="character voices" rel="noopener noreferrer">character voices</a> like this dark menacing one for Judgement Apocalypse Survival. I love providing voiceover for <a href="/game-trailer-voice" target="_blank" title="Game Trailer Voiceover">game trailers</a> and this especially fun because I got to try my most grizzled American voice. In fact, this voice sounds a lot like the 'In a world...' <a href="/movie-trailer-voice" target="_blank" title="Movie Trailer Voiceover">movie trailer voice</a> we all know and love so much. The game looks pretty good and the reviews seem positive, which makes it all the more fun to be part of. If you'd like to hear a couple more examples of similar work, check out my <a href="/warwings-game-trailer-voice" target="_blank" title="Warwings">Warwings</a> and <a href="/lifeless-game-trailer-voice" target="_blank" title="Lifeless Game Trailer">Lifeless</a> videos. </p>7:["slug","judgment-apocalypse-survival-voice","d"]
