e Apocalypse is here. Demons all around. Build, manage and defend your base in a post apocalyptic colony simulation\",\"uploadDate\":\"2016-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Judgment Apocalypse Survival"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>The Judgment Apocalypse Survival Voice over for the trailer. You can pretty much gather I love voicing trailers.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6YcpADKL15U","title":"Judgment Apocalypse Survival","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/judgment-pocalypse-survival-voice.jpg","alt":"Judgment Apocalypse Survival Voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>What is the game all about?</h2>\r\n<p><i>The Apocalypse is here. Demons all around. Now, it’s time to fight back! Build, manage and defend your base in a post apocalyptic colony simulation. <br>\r\nWill you survive Judgment day?</i> <a href=\"https://www.judgmentgame.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Judgement Apocalypse Survival\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Judgement Apocalypse Survival</a> is an extremely impressive new game from Suncrash Studios. The game is available on Steam and it has very high critic scores, so it' must be as good as it looks!</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Do you have a <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">trailer</a> or <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">promo</a> in need of a voice?<br>\r\nHow something like this Judgment Apocalypse Survival Voice? Please <a href=\"/contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a><br>\r\nTo make the process even easier, just let me know the intended length and usage, and I can quote you more accurately. Send a short sample of the script and I'll send you a short audition. Check to see if my voice is right for your project. <br>\r\nPlease do get in touch today.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Judgment Apocalypse Survival","pageUrl":"judgment-apocalypse-survival-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","632",{"href":"/dpd-predict-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/dpd-predict-voice.jpg","alt":"DPD Predict Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"DPD Predict Voice"}]]}],["$","$L4","848",{"href":"/le-becks-natual-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/le-becks-natual-voiceover.jpg","alt":"le-becks-natual-voiceover"